Third-party components
======================

This program does NOT bundle or redistribute any dictionary data.

On first run, build_dict.py downloads the source data from its official
repository and builds a local database on the user's own machine. Nothing in
this repository contains ECDICT content.

  ECDICT
  https://github.com/skywind3000/ECDICT
